WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.626 --> 00:00:01.919
Lin:
I’m in serious trouble.

00:00:01.919 --> 00:00:03.003
♪♪

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:04.546
Lin:
But for now, I was free.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:10.385
♪♪

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:11.762
Lin:
It took me a long time...

00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:13.597
♪♪

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:16.725
Lin:
some hard lessons to learn
what I know about chasing redemption.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:20.395
Lin:
I was a wanted man with a price
on my head.

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:21.980
♪♪

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:22.397
(Gasp)

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:25.192
Lin:
But for now, I was free.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.654
♪♪

00:00:28.654 --> 00:00:31.406
Lin:
I was on the run with no home
and no country.

00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:34.534
Lin:
Bombay was a place where
everyone started new.

00:00:34.785 --> 00:00:39.206
♪♪

00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:39.831
Karla:
Look out!

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:41.750
Karla:
You’re lucky I was here.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.293
Lin:
Maybe you’re my guardian angel.

00:00:43.794 --> 00:00:46.588
Karla:
Definitely not, there’s too
much devil in me for that.

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:50.467
♪♪

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:52.219
Kavita:
What brings you to Bombay, Lin?

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:53.387
Karla:
Tell her nothing.

00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:54.513
Karla:
We all have secrets.

00:00:55.305 --> 00:00:57.474
I’ll show you mine if you show
me yours.

00:00:57.474 --> 00:00:59.935
♪♪

00:00:59.935 --> 00:01:01.728
Prabhu:
I am number one guide in
Bombay.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.605
Thank you, but no.

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:04.231
Prabhu:
Yes sir.

00:01:04.523 --> 00:01:07.693
But only after three no’s it
is a true no.

00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:09.820
♪♪

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:11.697
This is Sagar Wada, my home.

00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:13.407
♪♪

00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:16.702
Prabhu:
This place is not working
without everyone helping each other.

00:01:16.702 --> 00:01:18.287
♪♪

00:01:18.287 --> 00:01:20.038
Why do you help in Sagar Wada?

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:22.457
I know what I did, what I need
to pay for.

00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:24.710
♪♪

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:26.628
Khader:
We still find a way to balance
our bad.

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:28.714
♪♪

00:01:28.714 --> 00:01:31.550
For a man who doesn’t want
trouble, you keep interesting
company.

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:32.676
♪♪

00:01:32.676 --> 00:01:36.555
When I ask something of you, you
will do it, or this place will
burn.

00:01:36.555 --> 00:01:40.100
♪♪

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.102
Karla:
Everyone here is running away
from something.

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.520
♪♪

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:44.980
It doesn’t work, trust me.

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:47.482
♪♪

00:01:47.482 --> 00:01:48.608
Lin:
I’m in serious trouble.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.485
I’m not going back empty handed.

00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:52.738
♪♪

00:01:52.738 --> 00:01:54.364
You should have gone when you
had the chance.

00:01:54.364 --> 00:01:58.577
♪♪

00:01:58.577 --> 00:02:00.662
Karla:
You can be free of anything but
yourself.

00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:03.165
♪♪

00:02:03.165 --> 00:02:05.208
I guess I need to be running
towards something.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.085
Lin:
Not away from it.

00:02:07.085 --> 00:02:15.552
♪♪

